luscdn.com&oh=00_AfuXgM6l_AfbUjWsZ8kWkau1wrQ4XgoefUm2HKdGVsIoSQ&oe=69A0575A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "284612080076581", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974910_284612083409914_181064660682537571_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EtMOOCpVK1oQ7kNvwF4R-8q&_nc_oc=Adnr9QB-DtF1jcfaiifKmoUBFHyjrZiHIiQdhYIyGq7vKmTjpGlBbfTzTzN3oSDtzi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv_jWX5Hf13rv68WqFTR-vkR8cist-c3GSh-qAT-FBRyA&oe=69A025F4"}, "display_name": "Wack-Ammo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You are armed with a Wack-A-Mole game and a gun to eliminate your targets in each new gallery.  The trick is, you must keep playing Wack-A-Mole to keep your gun loaded.  \n\nEach level ups the challenge and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwback to the old light gun games of the 8 bit era. The hand drawn 2D graphics put you inside these classic shooters with the added flare of VR.\n\n* 9 Unique Levels \n* Different Guns & Wackers Each Gallery\n* Unlock Badges For Your \"Wall Of Achievement\" With Each Victory\n*Earned Trophies Come To Life In Your Home Gallery\n\nWack-Ammo is a must play for every Quest owner.", "short_description": "You are armed with a Wack-A-Mole game and a gun to eliminate your targets in each new gallery.  The trick is, you must keep playing Wack-A-Mole to keep your gun loaded.  \n\nEach level ups the challenge and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwback to the old light gun games of the 8 bit era. The hand drawn 2D graphics put you inside these classic shooters with the added flare of VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://johnray32875.wixsite.com/johnraygames/wackammo", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "John Ray Games", "support_websit